The Meteor Spawn
So far, the meteors are just prefabs with no way of getting into the scene. You need an object
to be responsible for spawning the meteors at an interval. Create a new empty game object,
rename it Meteor Spawn, and place it at (0, 8, 0). Create a new script named MeteorSpawn in
